      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Re-read the sources of truth. Decide if anything changed enough to act.\nThe goal is not an agent that never stops, but one that stops, sleeps, and wakes up with context.",
